  "root_idea": {
    "summary": "The root centers on holding back, confining, or keeping something within bounds.",
    "development": "From this core develop the act of imprisoning, the prison as a place of confinement, and the state of being imprisoned. Classical usage also extends the idea to restraint, hardness, permanence, and specialized names such as سِجِّين.",
