          "usage_conditions": "The Quranic occurrences in the story of Joseph use the kasra form for the prison as a place of confinement. The lexical discussion also records a fatḥ reading in 12:33 as the related verbal noun 'imprisonment'; that vocalization distinction is not treated as a separate QAC form group.",
